{"id":"5e6ebb50934d5ffd","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-game3-behavioral-strategy.md","title":"ZFC Game3 Behavioral Strategy","display":"df-zfc-game3-behavioral-strategy — ZFC Game3 Behavioral Strategy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game3-behavioral-strategy","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game3-behavioral-strategy"],"display":"df-zfc-game3-behavioral-strategy — ZFC Game3 Behavioral Strategy","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game3-behavioral-strategy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game3-behavioral-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game3-behavioral-strategy — ZFC Game3 Behavioral Strategy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,P,i,b\\in V\">\\(H,P,i,b\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_H:V\\to V,\\quad D_H\\in V\">\\(A_H:V\\to V,\\quad D_H\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3BehavioralStrategy}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3BehavioralStrategy}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}behavioral\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash A_H(h)\\coloneqq\\{a:h^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in H\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}behavioral\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash A_H(h)\\coloneqq\\{a:h^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in H\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}behavioral\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash D_H\\coloneqq\\{h\\in H:A_H(h)\\neq\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}behavioral\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash D_H\\coloneqq\\{h\\in H:A_H(h)\\neq\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}behavioral\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcGame3BehavioralStrategy}_S(H,P,i,b)\\leftrightarrow\\varnothing\\in H\\land\\exists A,I,B\\;\\left(H\\subseteq A^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(k\\leq\\operatorname{lh}(h)\\to h\\upharpoonright k\\in H)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P,D_H,I)\\land i\\in I\\land B=\\bigcup_{h\\in D_H}[0,1]^{A_H(h)}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\{h\\in D_H:P(h)=i\\},B)\\land\\forall h\\in D_H\\;(P(h)=i\\to\\mathrm{Finite}(A_H(h))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b(h),A_H(h),[0,1])\\land\\sum_{a\\in A_H(h)}b(h)(a)=1)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}behavioral\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcGame3BehavioralStrategy}_S(H,P,i,b)\\leftrightarrow\\varnothing\\in H\\land\\exists A,I,B\\;\\left(H\\subseteq A^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(k\\leq\\operatorname{lh}(h)\\to h\\upharpoonright k\\in H)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P,D_H,I)\\land i\\in I\\land B=\\bigcup_{h\\in D_H}[0,1]^{A_H(h)}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\{h\\in D_H:P(h)=i\\},B)\\land\\forall h\\in D_H\\;(P(h)=i\\to\\mathrm{Finite}(A_H(h))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b(h),A_H(h),[0,1])\\land\\sum_{a\\in A_H(h)}b(h)(a)=1)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A behavioral strategy assigns a probability distribution to the available actions at each decision history of player <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":